dence Policy</a><a href="black-file.html">Black File</a><a href="download-center.html">Download Center</a><a href="feed-center.html">Feed Center</a></div><div class="nav-group"><strong>Control Maps</strong><a href="power-atlas.html">Power Atlas</a><a href="network-maps.html">Network Maps</a><a href="network-map-index.html">Map Index</a><a href="authority-hub.html">Authority Hub</a><a href="answer-engine.html">AI Answers</a><a href="schema-index.html">Machine Index</a></div><div class="nav-group"><strong>Freedom Ecosystem</strong><a href="live-intel.html">Live Intel Machine</a><a href="news.html">Intel Desk</a><a href="videos.html">Rumble Channels</a><a href="forum.html">Signal Board</a><a href="timers.html">Timers</a><a href="distribution-center.html">Distribution</a><a href="update-monitor.html">Update Monitor</a></div></div></details></nav></header><!-- page-guide:start --><section class="page-guide wrap"><div><span class="label">You are here</span><h2>Site route</h2><p>This page is part of the wider reporting system. Start with the summary, then open the evidence route or research tools for deeper source work.</p></div><div class="page-guide-chips"><span>Summary</span><span>Evidence</span><span>Research</span><span>Search</span></div><div class="page-guide-actions"><a class="btn" href="daily-command-brief.html">Today</a><a class="btn alt" href="evidence-vault.html">Evidence</a><a class="btn alt" href="research-tools.html">Research Tools</a></div></section><!-- page-guide:end --><!-- reader-governor:start --><section class="reader-governor-strip"><div><strong>Matrix Reprogrammed</strong><span>Reports, records, people, institutions, money routes and missing files.</span></div><nav><a href="daily-command-brief.html">Daily Brief</a><a href="control-structure.html">Power Map</a><a href="entities.html">Entities</a><a href="investigations.html">Investigations</a><a href="evidence-vault.html">Evidence</a><a href="search.html">Search</a></nav></section><!-- reader-governor:end --><main class="wrap section"><div class="eyebrow">Visual Card Layer</div><h1>CARD PRODUCTION PIPELINE.</h1><p class="lead">A practical workflow for producing playable, downloadable card artwork in consistent batches while the site data layer carries live scores, links, feed updates and dossiers.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="card-intelligence-feed.html">Card Intelligence Feed</a><a class="btn alt" href="card-batch-tracker.html">Open Batch Tracker</a><a class="btn alt" href="card-dossier-standard.html">Dossier Standard</a><a class="btn alt" href="card-downloads.html">Card Downloads</a><a class="btn alt" href="card-system-health.html">Card Health</a><a  class="btn alt machine-data-link" href="data/card-download-manifest.json">Machine-readable data</a></div><section class="section"><h2>Batch Workflow</h2><div class="pipeline-grid"><article class="pipeline-card"><div class="step">01</div><h3>Select 10 cards</h3><p>Choose the next ten missing or reader field artwork slots from the manifest.</p></article><article class="pipeline-card"><div class="step">02</div><h3>Generate final artwork</h3><p>Use the same frame, palette, symbolic layout and dimensions for every card in the batch.</p></article><article class="pipeline-card"><div class="step">03</div><h3>Install assets</h3><p>Save each card as its own SVG now, then later add PNG and print-ready exports.</p></article><article class="pipeline-card"><div class="step">04</div><h3>Verify downloads</h3><p>Check the deck wall, card download hub, profile route, intelligence feed, batch tracker, dossier standard and health dashboard.</p></article></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Feed & Scoring System</h2><p class="lead">Each card receives a relevance score, scoring dimensions, confidence marker, update triggers and a speculative research-routing reason explaining why the card belongs in the deck.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="card-intelligence-feed.html">Open Feed</a><a  class="btn alt machine-data-link" href="data/card-intelligence-feed.json">Machine-readable data</a><a class="btn alt" href="downloads/card-intelligence-feed.md">Readable Export</a></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Card Rules</h2><div class="pipeline-grid"><article class="pipeline-card"><h3>One card, one image</h3><p>The visual card is a complete individual asset, not a text overlay or cropped screenshot.</p></article><article class="pipeline-card"><h3>Data stays live</h3><p>Scores and links update in the dossier layer, so the artwork remains stable and playable.</p></article><article class="pipeline-card"><h3>Clean deck wall</h3><p>The deck page shows the card image first with small buttons below for dossier and download.</p></article><article class="pipeline-card"><h3>Dossier behind every card</h3><p>Each card opens an information page with score, timeline, source routes and submission form.</p></article></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Dossier Standard</h2><p class="lead">Every card profile should contain card artwork, live score panel, evidence boundary, source routes, timeline, related cards, related pages, intelligence-feed rationale and community intake.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="btn" href="card-dossier-standard.html">Open Dossier Standard</a></div></section><section class="section"><h2>Art Direction</h2><p class="lead">Museum-grade esoteric playing-card artwork, engraved linework, dark parchment, gold details, sharp border, readable hierarchy, no visual clutter, no broken typography.</p><p class="mini">Target structure: corner rank, suit marker, central portrait/seal, symbolic background, evidence-boundary ribbon, full-card download-safe composition.</p></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-07-01","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","launch-room.html","offer-center.html","source-document-vault.html","evidence-vault.html","black-file.html"]}</script></main><footer class="footer wrap"><p><strong>Production rule:</strong> build artwork in batches of ten and verify every download before moving to the next batch.</p></footer></div><script src="matrix.js"></script><script src="analytics.js"></script></body></html>